{"id": "288407", "name": "מציאת אופרטור נורמלי על פולינומים ע\"פ ע\"ע", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V=\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 2}[x]\\)</span> מרחב הפולינומים ממעלה קטנה או שווה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\)</span> במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</p><p>נגדיר על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> את המכפלה הפנימית הבאה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\langle f,g \\rangle = f(1)g(1) + f(0)g(0) + f(-1)g(-1).\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו אופרטור נורמלי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:V\\to V\\)</span> עם ערכים עצמיים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}}, {{CT:2}}\\)</span>.</p><p>כתבו את ערכי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span> על הפולינומים הבאים:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(T(1) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(T(x) = \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(T(x^2) = \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>הערה: </b>הזינו בתשובה פולינום ממעלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\)</span> לכל היותר במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> באות קטנה.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">למשל, כדי להזין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T(1)=x^2+3x-7\\)</span> הזינו <code dir=\"ltr\">x^2 + 3*x - 7</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "X", "allowwords": "x", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "X", "allowwords": "x", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "X", "allowwords": "x", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "checkAns: is(max(hipow(ans1,x),hipow(ans2,x),hipow(ans3,x)) <= 2);\nbaseMat:matrix([1/sqrt(3),0,-sqrt(2)/sqrt(3)],[0,1/sqrt(2),0],[0,0,sqrt(3)/sqrt(2)]);\nansMat:matrix([coeff(ans1,x,0),coeff(ans2,x,0),coeff(ans3,x,0)],[coeff(ans1,x),coeff(ans2,x),coeff(ans3,x)],[coeff(ans1,x,2),coeff(ans2,x,2),coeff(ans3,x,2)]);\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "checkAns", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">באחת מתשובותיך לא הזנת פולינום ממעלה לכל היותר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\)</span> במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "invert(baseMat) . ansMat . baseMat", "tans": "transpose(invert(baseMat) . ansMat . baseMat)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">האופרטור שמצאת איננו נורמלי על פי המכפלה הפנימית הנתונה.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "expand(charpoly(invert(baseMat) . ansMat . baseMat,x))", "tans": "-(x-eig1)*(x-eig2)*(x-eig3)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, יפה מאוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הערכים העצמיים של האופרטור שמצאת אינם נכונים.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "eig3+(eig1-eig3)*x^2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.3, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הפולינום הראשון נכון!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "eig2 * x", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.3, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הפולינום השני נכון!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "eig1*x^2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true":